<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Jan trade deficit revised to 645.2 mln Sfr.</title>
<headline>Swiss Jan trade deficit revised to 645.2 mln Sfr.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's trade deficit in January was revised to 645.2 million Swiss francs from the 686.7 million gap first reported, the Federal Customs Office said.</p>
<p>It gave these revised figures:</p>
<p> Balance  (million Sfr)	  - 645.2</p>
<p> Imports  (million Sfr)	  8,329.6</p>
<p> Exports  (million Sfr)	  7,684.4</p>
<p>Note - Original 686.7 million deficit, imports 8,315.0 million and exports 7,628.3 million. Figues exclude precious metals, precious stones, art objects and antiques.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
